Subject: [PATCH 2092/5749] perf(directory-injectors): skip writeFileSync when
 no new paths injected

---
 .../injector.test.ts                          | 114 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../directory-agents-injector/injector.ts     |   6 +-
 .../injector.test.ts                          | 114 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../directory-readme-injector/injector.ts     |   6 +-
